    rdfs:comment "The guidance document's 'Type of information' column, verbatim: who may access the data point."@en ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://ref.openepcis.org/vocab/ec-battery-passport-guidance/3.2> .

ecbp:definedIn
