    a rdf:Property, cccev:InformationRequirement ;
    rdfs:label "The material composition of the battery, including its chemistry, hazardous substances present in the battery, other than mercury, cadmium or lead, and critical raw materials present in the battery"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "European Commission Battery Passport data point 16 (BR Annex XIII 1 (b)). Applicability as of Feb 2027 — EV: notToBeFilled (Not to be filled/displayed - repetition, same data already required under previous data points); LMT: notToBeFilled (Not to be filled/displayed - repetition, same data already required under previous data points Not to be filled/displayed as of February 2027- format still to be specified in the upcoming implementing act); industrial: notToBeFilled (Not to be filled/displayed - repetition, same data already required under previous data points Not to be filled/displayed as of February 2027- format still to be specified in the upcoming implementing act). Static master data (resolver-served); access tier: public. Carried by eubat:hasMaterialComposition. Aggregate of data points 12 (chemistry), 13 (hazardous substances) and 15 (critical raw materials); the guidance resolves the regulation's internal redundancy by not filling the aggregate."@en ;
    skos:notation "16" ;
    dcterms:bibliographicCitation "BR Annex XIII 1 (b)"@en ;
    dcterms:source <http://data.europa.eu/eli/reg/2023/1542/oj> ;
