<https://ref.openepcis.org/vocab/ec-battery-passport-guidance/3.2#dp-70>
    a rdf:Property, cccev:InformationRequirement ;
    rdfs:label "Periodically recorded information on the operating environmental conditions, including temperature [code list, histogram, related units]"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "European Commission Battery Passport data point 70 (BR Annex XIII 4 (d)). Applicability as of Feb 2027 — EV: conditional (Applicable as soon as the battery starts to be used); LMT: conditional (Applicable as soon as the battery starts to be used); industrial: conditional (Applicable as soon as the battery starts to be used). Dynamic (folded from the EPCIS event stream at item level); access tier: legitimateInterest. Carried by eubat:timeSpentInExtremeTemperaturesAboveBoundary, eubat:timeSpentInExtremeTemperaturesBelowBoundary. Periodic recording is the EPCIS sensorElementList mechanism (sensorReport time series with sensorMetadata), not a master-data attribute."@en ;
